---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="changelog · tracelane"
  description="release notes and changelog for tracelane."
>
  <section class="container-prose py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mb-4 tracking-wider lowercase">
      changelog
    </p>
    <h1
      class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg lowercase"
    >
      changelog.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      detailed release notes live at
      <a
        href="https://github.com/tracelane/tracelane/releases"
        class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg transition-colors"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        github.com/tracelane/tracelane/releases
      </a>. each release is Cosign-signed with SLSA Build L3 provenance.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-16 space-y-12">
      <article>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim lowercase tracking-wider">
          unreleased
        </p>
        <h2
          class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-fg lowercase"
        >
          v1.0.0 — coming tue jun 16, 2026
        </h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted lowercase">
          <li>— rust gateway across 35 LLM providers</li>
          <li>— full-fidelity OTel GenAI observability backend</li>
          <li>— 12 inline predictive guardrails (sub-50ms p99)</li>
          <li>— prompt promotion + eval gates + auto-rollback</li>
          <li>— audit ledger: Ed25519 + merkle + Sigstore Rekor</li>
          <li>— CLI: tlane import-helicone, tlane import-litellm, tlane verify</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-16 text-sm text-fg-subtle lowercase">
      get notified when v1 ships —
      <a href="/#notify" class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg">
        notify list
      </a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
